                                                "text": "His holiness  has put out a warrant for Fassith’s arrest, but she is most likely camped out with Clavacius somewhere, both of them, safe and sound… for now.",
                                                "choices": {
                                                    "0": {
                                                        "text": "Who do I report to?",
                                                        "tree": {
                                                            "0": {
                                                                "emotion": "explain",
                                                                "text": "Why, this is good news for you, my friend! It means you are to receive a promotion! As Advisor of Lavera Roma, High Bishop of Guild City, I hereby instate the title of High Commander upon you."
                                                            },
